# Calm Before the Storm (CoP 7-4): the death guards, Cid below 7, Sueleen without the letters. qm_dalham spawns
# Dalham (YOU_ARE_NOT_ALONE, 7464); a GM sets nmBibiki 2; after his death
# qm_dalham has no 41; his body still counts as spawned, so no new pop: NOTHING_LEFT_INTEREST (7634, the default). The
# same for _0p4 and Boggelmann (7624, then nmMisareaux 2: NOTHING_ELSE_OF_INTEREST, 7625). Cid at the CID nibble 6:
# his default 500. At 7 with the letters: 895; finished, the rezone resets oncePerZone: 895 again. The letters taken
# away (a GM): Sueleen plays her default 20 (the zone's DefaultActions).
lists BibikiBay/qm_dalham/onTrigger MisareauxCoast/_0p4/onTrigger Metalworks/Cid/onTrigger SealionsDen/Sueleen/onTrigger
char zone=BibikiBay pos=97,-44.7,937 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop CalmBeforeTheStorm current
login
trigger qm_dalham                       # Dalham spawned: 7464
localvar Mission[6][738]nmBibiki 2      # a GM
kill #16793928                          # Dalham killed
trigger qm_dalham                       # 2: 7634 (the default)
warp -309,-34,184 MisareauxCoast
trigger _0p4                            # Boggelmann spawned: 7624
localvar Mission[6][738]nmMisareaux 2   # a GM
kill BOGGELMANN                         # Boggelmann killed
trigger _0p4                            # 2: 7625 (the default)
warp -12,-12,1 Metalworks
missionstatus Cop 6 pos=6               # a GM: bits 1 and 2
trigger Cid                             # 6: his default 500
finish-if-event
missionstatus Cop 7 pos=6               # a GM
keyitem LettersFromUlmiaAndPrishe       # a GM
trigger Cid                             # the letters: 895
finish
rezone
trigger Cid                             # a new zone visit: 895 again
finish
delkeyitem LettersFromUlmiaAndPrishe    # a GM
warp 612,132,776 SealionsDen
trigger Sueleen                         # no letters: her default 20
finish-if-event
